# Optional local override for the estimation engine root.
# One path per file (absolute, or relative to current_model/).
#
# Prefer STEEL_ENGINE_ROOT in .env for all environments.
# Example:
#   /opt/steel-beam-estimation/current_model
#   ../../active_engine
#
# Leave this file absent when the engine is packaged into current_model/
# (Run_PY present) or when STEEL_ENGINE_ROOT is set.
